 to be a stationary distribution for \(X(t)\) if" 称为 \(X(t)\) 的平稳分布，若 Pishro-Nik, 2014, section 11.3.2 11.3.3 The Generator Matrix 生成元矩阵 (No definition) （无定义） Pishro-Nik, 2014, section 11.3.3 Generator Matrix 生成元矩阵 "For a continuous-time Markov chain, we define the generator matrix \(G\). The \((i,j)	ext{th}\) entry of the transition matrix is given by \( egin{align} 
